    <!-- ===================== Help ===================== -->
    <system:String x:Key="Str.Help.Title">HELP &amp; DOWNLOAD</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str.Help.Intro">This launcher does not download or install anything automatically: here you'll only find the official links for the required components and the steps to place them in the folder structure the app expects.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str.Help.DownloadsHeader">WHERE TO DOWNLOAD THE COMPONENTS</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str.Help.OpenLink">Open ↗</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str.Help.QuickInstallHeader">QUICK INSTALLATION GUIDE</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str.Help.SupportHeader">SUPPORT</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str.Help.Support1">If the indicator at the top is red or the Home screen reports an incomplete installation, go to the Diagnostics screen: it lists exactly which file or folder is missing.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str.Help.Support2">If maps don't show up or previews are missing, try Settings → Refresh maps. If the problem persists, Settings → Clear preview cache and then Refresh maps again.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str.Help.Support3">For Internet multiplayer, remember: Windows firewall, router port forwarding and public IP address are not handled automatically by this app (see the info box on the Multiplayer screen).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str.Help.CreditsHeader">DEVELOPER</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str.Help.CreditsEmailLabel">Requests, bug reports or fixes:</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str.Help.CreditsEmailButton">✉ Write</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str.Help.CreditsDonateInfo">If this launcher is useful to you, you can buy the developer a coffee.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Str.Help.CreditsDonateButton">💛 Donate (PayPal)</system:String>
